t.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>This study was initially begun in the lab of Carla B. Green at the University of Virginia. She provided some lab space, reagents, and technician salary to help with tissue sectioning (NIH MH61461 (CBG)). After moving to University of Wisconsin-Whitewater I used my startup money as well as money from an internal grant (Faculty Development Grant) to continue the analysis. My summer salary, the salary of two students, and reagents for one summer (2005) was provided by an NSF REU 0354140 (Woller). More recent experiments were also funded by the Beta Beta Beta Biological Society. Experiments were discussed with CBG, but my project was independent from other projects going on in her laboratory (she did not pay me a salary to start these experiments). The NSF REU (Woller) was meant to give undergraduates research training during the summer and Woller had no input on the types of experiments performed. CBG kindly read and edited this manuscript.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>